+
+## Privacy and security
+
+See [the data inventory and independent audit procedure](docs/privacy-security.md). Accounts and third-party tracking are disabled pending review. Reading lists use ephemeral single-process memory, expire after 24 hours and can be deleted from the reading-list menu. Restarts discard saved lists.
+
+Build with `pnpm run build`. Run unit tests with `pnpm run test:privacy`. To include HTTP privacy checks, start the production build on port 4321, then run `PRIVACY_TEST_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4321 pnpm run test:privacy`. These checks do not use a browser. Run `pnpm audit` for dependency findings.
